    {
      "id": "0u11LB4aIC",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "🤖 **Applying knowlddedge of `@orchestrator`...**"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "Tt4qcafJ57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Here are some broken sentences you can copy and paste into your **Research Editor** to test the **Neural Refine** and **Spellcheck** systems:"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "KSCkpfABoD",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "### 🔬 Test Set 01: Simple Spelling &amp; Grammar"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6stEsnfYQc",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "&gt; \"The quick brown foxcc **jump** over the **lasy** dog because it **dont** know how to bark at the **skyed**.\""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4E4hZibcE6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "### 🏛️ Test Set 02: Research Jargon &amp; Mixed Tense"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yX8m9ztBLS",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "&gt; \"The **researchs** **indicate** that the data **are consistant** with the hypothesis, but the results **is showing** no significant change in the **analisis**.\""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "LSqz1DP9JY",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "### 🌍 Test Set 03: Casual but Broken"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1p2-to7Von",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "&gt; \"I **is** going to the **markit** to **buyed** some fresh apples and **bannanas** because my **freind** want to **cooke** a pie.\""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "45qMU6hRGO",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "***"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aOsXBGwbx6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "**How to test:**"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6CQku3HBlT",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "1.  **Paste** these into your editor."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28v8OEAH9L",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "2.  You should see **Red Underlines** on words like *markit*, *bannanas*, and *analisis*."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "KdbN_ew2Ve",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "3.  Click the **Neural Refine (Sparkle)** button."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gWKkr9-crO",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "4.  The AI should fix the tenses (\"indicates\" instead of \"indicate\") and correct the structural errors automatically!"
      }
    }
  ],
  "version": "2.31.6"
}